        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Listener slots on one agent. The component&apos;s probe reports these from Blueprint IsBound(); a raw <ref refid="class_f_tryll_agent" kindref="compound">FTryllAgent</ref> reports them from its callback slots. ToolCallDetailed suppresses the agent&apos;s generic OnNodeEvent (C++ AgentProxy parity) even though the session-level detailed event does not. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
